WEBVTT

00:01:29.919 --> 00:01:31.420
There are a lot of scammers,

00:01:31.462 --> 00:01:33.881
people who simply took
a three-month course,

00:01:33.923 --> 00:01:36.467
tarot card readers or astrologers

00:01:36.467 --> 00:01:38.928
who say they're
professional psychologists.

00:01:39.303 --> 00:01:40.513
As a result,

00:01:40.513 --> 00:01:43.599
a lot of people don't know
how to choose a professional

00:01:43.641 --> 00:01:45.226
who fits their profile

00:01:45.226 --> 00:01:48.688
or are even victimized
by such unprofessional help.

00:01:49.438 --> 00:01:53.234
In the absence of regulation
and interest by the state,

00:01:53.276 --> 00:01:54.986
I saw an opportunity.

00:01:55.486 --> 00:01:57.780
With my team, we created a platform

00:01:57.822 --> 00:02:00.449
with an assessment system
for psychologists